I used to ascend without killing the WoY a lot.  The idea is to
paralyze him and leave him behind on other levels.
The game was changed to make this harder, but IIRC it is still
possible.  Try a flock of pet floating eyes and a cloak of
displacement.  Wear your ring of free action.

A while ago I suggested the concept of trying to ascend an
'ultrapacifist' - completing the game with a null kill list. That is
extremely difficult, even in wizard mode (if you don't wish for the
altar/"AoY)



